cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果使用了本仓库的代码、数据或文档，请按以下信息引用。If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "MissionSoftware: Mission Software Engineering — a Microkit mission shell and controlled-experiment pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "陈"
    given-names: "鹏"
    alias: "Chen Peng"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KOS-TL/MissionSoftware"
url: "https://github.com/KOS-TL/MissionSoftware"
abstract: >-
  A mission-constrained shell on seL4 Microkit (gatekeeper + client protection domains) and a
  pre-registered controlled-experiment pipeline comparing traditional-process and mission-layer gates.
  Explicit entrustment AND current action still aligned with it AND falsifiable checks; delivery is not achievement.
  All experiment results are environment self-checks on an author-written corpus, not confirmatory evidence.
keywords:
  - mission software engineering
  - seL4
  - Microkit
  - controlled experiment
  - pre-registration
